{"slice": {"slice_id": "s_isoler", "introduces": [{"id": "eq5", "type": "math", "content": "3x - 2 - 2x = 2x + 12 - 2x"}, {"id": "eq6", "type": "math", "content": "x - 2 = 12"}, {"id": "eq7", "type": "math", "content": "x = 12 + 2"}, {"id": "eq8", "type": "math", "content": "x = 14", "parts": [{"id": "x8", "text": "x"}, {"id": "v8", "text": "14"}]}], "beats": [{"id": "b_enleve", "say": "On enlève deux x des deux côtés, pour garder l'égalité tout en regroupant tous les x à gauche.", "cues": [{"id": "c_enleve", "text": "enlève deux x"}, {"id": "c_gauche", "text": "tous les x à gauche"}], "do": [{"id": "s_eq5", "verb": "show", "target": "eq5", "at": "cue:c_enleve"}, {"id": "t_eq6", "verb": "transform", "source": "eq5", "target": "eq6", "at": "cue:c_gauche"}]}, {"id": "b_ajoute", "say": "Maintenant, on ajoute deux des deux côtés : le moins deux disparaît à gauche.", "cues": [{"id": "c_ajoute", "text": "ajoute deux"}, {"id": "c_disparait", "text": "disparaît à gauche"}], "do": [{"id": "t_eq7", "verb": "transform", "source": "eq6", "target": "eq7", "at": "cue:c_ajoute"}, {"id": "t_eq8", "verb": "transform", "source": "eq7", "target": "eq8", "at": "cue:c_disparait"}, {"id": "h_eq8", "verb": "highlight", "target": "eq8", "role": "result", "at": "after:t_eq8"}], "pause_after": "normal"}]}}
{"slice": {"slice_id": "s_verifier", "introduces": [{"id": "ver_g", "type": "math", "content": "\\dfrac{3 \\times 14 - 2}{4} = \\dfrac{42 - 2}{4} = 10", "parts": [{"id": "g_a", "text": "\\dfrac{3 \\times 14 - 2}{4}"}, {"id": "g_b", "text": "\\dfrac{42 - 2}{4}"}, {"id": "g_c", "text": "10"}]}, {"id": "ver_d", "type": "math", "content": "\\dfrac{14 + 6}{2} = \\dfrac{20}{2} = 10", "parts": [{"id": "d_a", "text": "\\dfrac{14 + 6}{2}"}, {"id": "d_b", "text": "\\dfrac{20}{2}"}, {"id": "d_c", "text": "10"}]}, {"id": "egal", "type": "math", "content": "10 = 10 \\; \\checkmark", "style": {"role": "result"}}], "beats": [{"id": "b_gauche", "say": "On remplace x par quatorze dans l'équation de départ, un côté après l'autre. À gauche : trois fois quatorze donne quarante-deux, moins deux donne quarante, sur quatre, c'est dix.", "cues": [{"id": "c_remplace", "text": "On remplace x par quatorze"}, {"id": "c_gauche_mot", "text": "À gauche"}, {"id": "c_dix", "text": "c'est dix"}], "do": [{"id": "s_ver_g", "verb": "show", "target": "ver_g", "at": "cue:c_remplace"}, {"id": "w_g_a", "verb": "write", "target": "ver_g", "part": "g_a", "at": "cue:c_gauche_mot"}, {"id": "w_g_b", "verb": "write", "target": "ver_g", "part": "g_b", "at": "after:w_g_a"}, {"id": "w_g_c", "verb": "write", "target": "ver_g", "part": "g_c", "at": "cue:c_dix"}]}, {"id": "b_droite", "say": "À droite : quatorze plus six donne vingt, sur deux, c'est dix aussi. Les deux côtés sont égaux : quatorze est bien la solution.", "cues": [{"id": "c_droite_mot", "text": "À droite"}, {"id": "c_aussi", "text": "c'est dix aussi"}, {"id": "c_solution", "text": "quatorze est bien la solution"}], "do": [{"id": "s_ver_d", "verb": "show", "target": "ver_d", "at": "cue:c_droite_mot"}, {"id": "w_d_a", "verb": "write", "target": "ver_d", "part": "d_a", "at": "cue:c_droite_mot"}, {"id": "w_d_b", "verb": "write", "target": "ver_d", "part": "d_b", "at": "after:w_d_a"}, {"id": "w_d_c", "verb": "write", "target": "ver_d", "part": "d_c", "at": "cue:c_aussi"}, {"id": "s_egal", "verb": "show", "target": "egal", "at": "cue:c_solution"}, {"id": "h_egal", "verb": "highlight", "target": "egal", "role": "result", "at": "after:s_egal"}], "pause_after": "long"}]}}
{"slice": {"slice_id": "s_retenir", "introduces": [{"id": "chaine", "type": "math", "content": "\\dfrac{3x - 2}{4} = \\dfrac{x + 6}{2} \\;\\to\\; \\dfrac{3x - 2}{4} = \\dfrac{2(x+6)}{4} \\;\\to\\; 3x - 2 = 2x + 12", "parts": [{"id": "ch_depart", "text": "\\dfrac{3x - 2}{4} = \\dfrac{x + 6}{2}"}, {"id": "ch_etape", "text": "\\dfrac{3x - 2}{4} = \\dfrac{2(x+6)}{4}"}, {"id": "ch_fin", "text": "3x - 2 = 2x + 12"}], "style": {"role": "accent"}}, {"id": "sol", "type": "math", "content": "x = 14", "style": {"role": "result"}}, {"id": "val", "type": "text", "content": "les deux côtés valent 10", "layout": {"next_to": "sol", "direction": "down", "gap": "sm"}}], "groups": [{"id": "recap", "items": ["chaine", "sol", "val"], "arrange": {"direction": "down", "align": "left", "gap": "md"}}], "beats": [{"id": "b_idee", "say": "L'idée centrale à retenir : ne pas se mêler dans les dénominateurs, c'est les mettre identiques d'abord. Quand deux fractions ont le même dénominateur, l'égalité se réduit à celle des numérateurs.", "cues": [{"id": "c_idee", "text": "L'idée centrale à retenir"}, {"id": "c_identiques", "text": "les mettre identiques d'abord"}, {"id": "c_numerateurs", "text": "à celle des numérateurs"}], "do": [{"id": "f_eq8", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "eq8", "at": "beat:start"}, {"id": "f_ver_g", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "ver_g", "at": "beat:start"}, {"id": "f_ver_d", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "ver_d", "at": "beat:start"}, {"id": "f_egal", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "egal", "at": "beat:start"}, {"id": "cadre", "verb": "camera.focus", "targets": ["chaine", "sol", "val"], "bounds": "layout_bounds", "at": "cue:c_idee"}, {"id": "w_chaine", "verb": "write", "target": "chaine", "at": "cue:c_identiques"}, {"id": "h_ch_fin", "verb": "highlight", "target": "chaine", "part": "ch_fin", "role": "accent", "start": "cue:c_numerateurs", "end": "cue_end:c_numerateurs"}]}, {"id": "b_distribue_regroupe", "say": "Ensuite tu distribues, tu regroupes les x à gauche, et tu vérifies